/*  EXPECTED: REJECTED at type-check, identically by both backends.
    A foreign address got in an inner rabbit and given to a name made in an outer one,
    straight from the call, with no name of its own in between. The rabbit open where an
    address is got is the one whose Done. may free it, so that is where it lives. */

Pull a book on the c-language.
    Define c-language number release, given (the address p), as [({ free(the p); 0; })].
    Define c-language voidable address dup, given (the text s), as [strdup(the s)], and free it with release.
    Pull a rabbit.
        Define h as cast dup on ("outer").
        Pull a rabbit.
            The h becomes cast dup on ("inner").
        Done.
        State the text at h but void is "none".
    Done.
Done.
